<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia M3 money supply rises 3.2 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Zambia M3 money supply rises 3.2 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's year-on-year broadly defined M3 money supply rose by 3.2 percent in February after a 0.2 percent decline in January, the central bank said.</p>
<p>			     Feb 1997	  Jan 1997	Feb 1996</p>
<p>M3 (kwacha million)    578,410.1	 560,227.4     499,716.7</p>
<p>--Lusaka newsroom +2601-222-689</p>
